ot 62 000 views on  youtube  purely few years later professor from  the uk  ed hawkings takes less data  and creates this chart spiral chart  he posts it on twitter it went viral  in minutes  temperatures spiraling out of control  but then comes my favorite person  ignores all these charts and tells us a  story  and what's the story here hey i have to  go to this climate  conference but i'm not going to chat  because  i have integrity and i want to reduce my  carbon footprint and what's the data  here  look at these big waves behind me they  look so  menacing this is dangerous this is an  emergency  so same data three different ways to  tell the story  three different outcomes so summarizing  if you want to be awesome at data  visualization  first tell me a story second data is not  information  third know how to create knowledge  four make it memorable  five use narratives and six  choose a chart that is compatible thank  you very much

